<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  C — monogram — adaptive-icon foreground layer for TL;DR.

  The wordmark as a mark: same black weight and tight fit as WordmarkStyle, semicolon muted exactly as wordmark() mutes it.

  Drawn in the 108x108 adaptive viewport: only the central 72x72 is ever visible
  and only the r=33 circle around (54,54) is mask-safe, so the mark is centred and
  scaled to stay inside that circle on round, squircle and teardrop masks alike.
  White fill on purpose — the same layer is reused as the <monochrome> layer, where
  the system supplies its own tint and only shape and alpha survive.
-->
